{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your adventure begins in a modest motel, where the owner might call you for work - driving a van to pick up tourists from the ferry. You\u2019ll start with a clunky manual car, but if you manage your money wisely, you might just afford an upgrade. Be warned: every decision matters. Miss a rent payment? Run out of gas? Go broke? You\u2019re in trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you have what it takes to survive behind the wheel?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Realistic Driving Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Manual transmission, clutch control, and varied vehicle handling. <br>\ud83d\ude90 <strong>Diverse Vehicles</strong> \u2013 Drive everything from compact cars to massive trucks. <br>\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Hardcore Economy</strong> \u2013 Earn just enough to survive\u2026 if you play it smart. <br>\ud83c\udfe8 <strong>Island Life</strong> \u2013 Stay in a rundown motel, pay rent weekly, and work odd jobs. <br>\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Keep your car fueled, your stomach full, and your debts paid. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3533490?t=1743428846","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533490/5fb7dc9b7917fa3f35445fb53687a3f00a26f7b3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743428846","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533490/da7c7dd3da2c3fcdfdf723436d89e0e2c22dae1a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743428846","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533490/da7c7dd3da2c3fcdfdf723436d89e0e2c22dae1a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743428846","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_de